BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:galerie-noord-dertig-dertigers-2027@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261104T215458Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:Deadline: Galerie Noord: Dertig Dertigers 2027 (Groningen\, artists
  aged 30 to 39)
DESCRIPTION:To open its 30th anniversary year\, Galerie Noord in Groningen 
 is staging Dertig Dertigers\, a group exhibition of thirty artists in thei
 r thirties\, each showing one work. All disciplines are welcome\; the prop
 osed work may measure no more than 120 x 120 x 120 cm.\n\nOrganisation: St
 ichting Galerie Noord\nLocation: Galerie Noord\, Nieuwstad 6\, Groningen\,
  Netherlands. Open to artists living in the Netherlands born between 2 Jan
 uary 1987 and 1 January 1997 (aged 30 to 39 on 1 January 2027).\nAward: On
 e winner receives a EUR 1\,500 contribution towards their artistic practic
 e plus a solo exhibition at Galerie Noord (11 December 2027 to 13 January 
 2028). Thirty selected artists each show one work in the group exhibition\
 ; no fee for the other 29 is stated. No application fee mentioned.\nDurati
 on: Group exhibition 2 January to 10 February 2027\; winner's solo exhibit
 ion 11 December 2027 to 13 January 2028\n\nMore: https://www.galerienoord.
 nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2914_NOORD_Open-Call_Dertig-Dertigers_A4_ENG
 .pdf?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.galerienoord.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2914_NOORD_Open-
 Call_Dertig-Dertigers_A4_ENG.pdf?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm
 _medium=referral
LOCATION:Galerie Noord\, Nieuwstad 6\, Groningen\, Netherlands. Open to art
 ists living in the Netherlands born between 2 January 1987 and 1 January 1
 997 (aged 30 to 39 on 1 January 2027).
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kunstpunt-groningen-tschumi-pavilion-hellend-vlak-2027@artificialnouvea
 u.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261104T215458Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261104
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261105
SUMMARY:Deadline: Kunstpunt Groningen: Open Call Tschumi Pavilion (Hellend 
 Vlak 2027)
DESCRIPTION:Kunstpunt Groningen invites artists to propose a temporary\, si
 te-specific artwork for the Tschumi Pavilion on Hereplein\, Groningen\, vi
 ewable from outside\, that responds to current social and often polarised 
 issues. The brief asks how art can encourage us to look at today's social 
 issues in a different light.\n\nOrganisation: Kunstpunt Groningen\nLocatio
 n: Tschumi Pavilion\, Hereplein\, Groningen\, Netherlands. Applicants must
  currently work in the city or province of Groningen or have a demonstrabl
 e connection to it.\nAward: Up to three shortlisted artists receive EUR 1\
 ,500 (excl. VAT) each for a preliminary design\; the selected artist recei
 ves a EUR 17\,000 project budget\, including their fee. No application fee
 .\nDuration: Commission\; work on display 3 to 4 months (June to September
  2027)\n\nMore: https://www.kunstpuntgroningen.nl/en/tschumi-pavilion/open
 -call-tschumi-pavilion/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=r
 eferral
URL:https://www.kunstpuntgroningen.nl/en/tschumi-pavilion/open-call-tschumi
 -pavilion/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Tschumi Pavilion\, Hereplein\, Groningen\, Netherlands. Applicants
  must currently work in the city or province of Groningen or have a demons
 trable connection to it.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
