 ge\, the Hong Kong media art institute (est. 1986) known for critical work
  on XR\, AI\, blockchain and video games.\n\nOrganisation: Creative Indust
 ries Fund NL (Stimuleringsfonds Creatieve Industrie)\, with Videotage\nLoc
 ation: Hong Kong (Videotage premises). Only for applicants established in 
 the Netherlands\, Aruba\, Bonaire\, Curacao\, Saba\, Sint Eustatius or Sin
 t Maarten and registered with a Kingdom of the Netherlands business regist
 er (KvK).\nAward: One residency grant: EUR 5\,000 for a two-month work per
 iod or EUR 6\,500 for three months\, covering travel\, insurance\, living 
 expenses\, compensation for time invested\, and material and transport cos
 ts. Housing\, work space\, Videotage guidance and production costs are pai
 d by the Fund directly to Videotage on top of the grant\; accommodation is
  arranged by Videotage. No application fee.\nDuration: 23 March to 18 May 
 2027 (two months) or 23 March to 15 June 2027 (three months)\; state your 
 preferred period. Research period plus a concluding public presentation ev
 ent for Videotage's Hong Kong network.\n\nMore: https://www.stimuleringsfo
 nds.nl/en/grants/open-call-videotage?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk
 &utm_medium=referral
